{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awoken by a mysterious black cat on a stormy night, <strong>Vi</strong> \u2014 an ordinary boy \u2014 is lured into the <i>Under-Realm</i>: a dying world on the brink of collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters once ruled the land, but something far darker now rises to claim it. As the realm\u2019s final hours draw near, Vi must forge uneasy alliances to protect the last sparks of hope in a fading world\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or watch it all collapse into ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic 16-bit Action Combat:\u00a0</strong> Fight in real time using melee and magic against a wide range of enemies  and get stronger as you fight!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Pixel Art &amp; Music:</strong> A handcrafted world filled with eerie beauty, dynamic lighting, and an original moody soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Filled Exploration:</strong> Use your newfound skills acquired in the Under Realm to assist you on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Story:</strong>\u00a0Some actions have weight. Potentially different endings based on what happens in your playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duration:\u00a0</strong>Approx. 4 to 10 hours of gameplay depending on exploration.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900720?t=1767721096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900720?t=1767721096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900720/31ac1c8d002472a569edb92758e1af006c604a8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767721096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900720/31ac1